              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "It's A New Day"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I think this was overly sweet and I cut down the sugar in the berries. Maybe that would be a function of the berries. This isn't my favorite blackberry cobbler but not the worst. I think using juice instead of water and cutting down the sugar would help tremendously."
          },
          {
